### Register a rider
POST http://localhost:8083/api/riders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Karim Ahmed",
  "phone": "+8801812345678",
  "vehicleType": "BIKE"
}

### List all riders
GET http://localhost:8083/api/riders

### List available riders
GET http://localhost:8083/api/riders/available

### Create a delivery (simulates an order-confirmed event via REST)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-1001",
  "customerId": "REPLACE_WITH_A_USER_SERVICE_USER_ID",
  "restaurantId": "restaurant-501",
  "deliveryAddress": "12 Green Road, Dhaka",
  "pickupAddress": "Restaurant XYZ, Gulshan, Dhaka"
}

### Assign a rider (auto-picks first available rider if body is empty)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/deliveries/REPLACE_WITH_DELIVERY_ID/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Assign a specific rider
POST http://localhost:8083/api/deliveries/REPLACE_WITH_DELIVERY_ID/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "riderId": "REPLACE_WITH_RIDER_ID"
}

### Update status -> PICKED_UP
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/deliveries/REPLACE_WITH_DELIVERY_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PICKED_UP"
}

### Update status -> DELIVERED
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/deliveries/REPLACE_WITH_DELIVERY_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}

### Get delivery by id
GET http://localhost:8083/api/deliveries/REPLACE_WITH_DELIVERY_ID

### Get delivery by orderId (what Order Service / customers would call)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/deliveries/order/order-1001

### View deliveries assigned to a rider
GET http://localhost:8083/api/deliveries/rider/REPLACE_WITH_RIDER_ID

### Toggle rider availability off
PATCH http://localhost:8083/api/riders/REPLACE_WITH_RIDER_ID/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available": false
}
